00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:22.730
Gardein, wardein вЂ“ both old French words, mean the same thing.

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:24.440
Not so much in Japanese.

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.400
If you say so.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:31.700
She's not exactly easy to have a conversation with, though.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.490
Like she doesn't really listen to you.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.750
